WEBVTT

00:50:58.480 --> 00:51:04.119
now assisted by AI to do
the filtering and the ideation,

00:51:04.143 --> 00:51:09.104
may be able to create twice as many drugs
in his or her lifetime,

00:51:09.128 --> 00:51:12.609
thereby bringing
a lot of benefits to humanity.

00:51:12.633 --> 00:51:16.299
So that's an example
of human-AI symbiosis.

00:51:16.323 --> 00:51:19.331
CA: What I think was unique,
almost, in your analysis,

00:51:19.355 --> 00:51:21.244
or certainly was surprising to me,

00:51:21.268 --> 00:51:27.471
was that you have a strong story
to say to people who may not be creative,

00:51:27.495 --> 00:51:31.616
but you still think have a rich future.